              "Related article Trump warns China not to wait until after 2020 to strike a trade deal\n\nEarlier in the day, Trump had accused Beijing of depreciating its currency on Twitter, adding later that such measures have been used to “steal our business and factories, hurt our jobs, depress our workers’ wages and harm our farmers’ prices. Not anymore!”",
