            "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2019/08/06/us-china-trade-war-currency-manipulator-tag-after-yuan-passes-7-level.html",
            "title": "US-China trade war: Currency manipulator tag after yuan passes 7 level",
            "snippets": [
              "# The US and China are dragging currencies into their escalating fight. Here's what you need to know\n- Beijing allowed its currency, the yuan, to weaken to more than 7 per U.S. dollar — which led to the Trump administration labeling China a currency manipulator.\n- The label is mostly symbolic without \"major consequences on its own,\" Goldman Sachs analysts said in a report",
